    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classEvent" kindref="compound">Event</ref> dispatched when the window close button is clicked or a SDL_EVENT_QUIT is received. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This event is typically used to signal the application to shut down.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Dispatched by <ref refid="classSDLEventTranslator" kindref="compound">SDLEventTranslator</ref>. </para>
